 "groups": [
  {
   "shots": [
    "01",
    "02"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "First, sit Ben in a barrel, tie on a big rock, and push.",
     "key": [
      "rock"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "03",
    "04"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Down he goes... Congratulations, you've built a submarine!",
     "key": [
      "submarine"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "05"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Mm-mmm!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "06"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It can go down. It just can't come back up.",
     "key": [
      "up"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "07"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Water pushes up with the weight of the water you push aside.",
     "key": [
      "weight"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "08"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The rock weighs more than that, so it sinks.",
     "key": [
      "sinks"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "09",
    "10"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A beach ball weighs much less, so it pops right back up.",
     "key": [
      "less"
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Whoa-oh!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "11"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So heavy things sink, light things float, and the same weight hovers.",
     "key": [
      "hovers"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "12"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So you build a sub that can change its weight,",
     "key": [
      "weight"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "13"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "with two empty tanks on the sides.",
     "key": [
      "tanks"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "14"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Fishing time!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "15"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Full of air, it floats.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "16",
    "17"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Open the vents, the tanks fill with water, and down it goes.",
     "key": [
      "water"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "18",
    "19"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Too much water, and it sinks to the bottom.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "20"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Pump half the water out, and it weighs exactly as much as the water it pushes aside,",
     "key": [
      "exactly"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "21",
    "22"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "so it just hangs there in the water, perfectly still.",
     "key": [
      "still"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "23",
    "24"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "A propeller at the back pushes it along, past the weeds.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "25"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And a periscope pokes up to look around.",
     "key": [
      "periscope"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "26",
    "27"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And who's that up there? It's the neighbour, fishing.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "28"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Then his fishing hook snags the sub.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "29"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "neighbour",
     "text": "Big one!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "30"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ben drives off, towing him across the lake.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "31"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "neighbour",
     "text": "Biggest catch of my life!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "32",
    "33"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Deeper down, the water presses harder, one more atmosphere every ten metres.",
     "key": [
      "atmosphere"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "34",
    "35"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "It's getting tight in here... AAAH!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "36"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So Ben blows the tanks with compressed air,",
     "key": [
      "air"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "37"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "now it's lighter than the water, and up it shoots,",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "38",
    "39"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "right up under the neighbour's little boat. Oops.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "40"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Empty tanks: it floats again.",
     "key": [
      "floats"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "41"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "neighbour",
     "text": "Worst fishing trip ever."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "42",
    "43"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And there you have it. Congratulations, you've built a submarine!",
     "key": [
      "submarine"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "44"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "grandma",
     "text": "You know they sell snorkels, dear?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "45"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Now you tell me."
    }
   ]
  }
